  "details": "I can map my radiomaster pocket to the drone just fine in desktop but after 3 hours of fiddling I can't get it to control the drone. In the input testing world I managed to get input from all buttons and sticks after remapping some channels on the controller but it still doesnt control the drone while in vr with controllers. It seems unable to take input from \"Joystick1AxisX\". I would love to fly in vr and its kind of a bummer to have a drone with an FPV mode but its like pulling teeth to fly it with the proper controller.",
